                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Unfortunately the game did not start when using SteamVR. It crashes on startup. It gives a LowLevel Fatal Error. Without SteamVR the game did start but was unresponsive. I tried a lot of stuff people with similar errors (but other games) tried online but it did not work. Most of the reviews on this game are more than 8 years old. Mad_Bert is the of the most recent people who placed a review in 2025 and seems to encounter the same problem of the game crashing on startup. Do not buy this game. It does not work anymore",
